<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs up $1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs up $1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00 higher. Demand is mostly good for a light to moderate run. Top $61.50 per cwt. - USDAUS 1-2  230-260 lbs. 59.50-60.50, few 61.00-61.50 US 2-3  230-260 lbs. 58.50-59.50</p>
<p>Sows: 1.00 higher. Top 54.00. US 1-3  300-400 lbs. 45.00-48.50</p>
<p>	  400-500 lbs. 48.00-50.00, few 46.00-47.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs. 50.00-53.00</p>
<p>few over  600 lbs. 51.00-54.00</p>
</text>
